flowchart TD
    U[Pet owner] --> UI[Streamlit interface<br/>app.py]

    subgraph Scheduling[Original scheduling workflow]
        UI --> SV[Task and form validation]
        SV --> DM[Owner, Pet, and Task<br/>pawpal_system.py]
        DM --> SL[Rule-based scheduler<br/>priority and available time]
        SL --> PL[Daily plan]
        SL --> EX[Plan explanations]
        DM --> CC[Conflict detection]
        CC --> CW[Conflict warnings]
        PL --> UI
        EX --> UI
        CW --> UI
    end

    subgraph RAG[Retrieval-augmented AI workflow]
        UI --> QV[Question validation]
        QV --> RT[TF-IDF RAG retriever]
        RT --> KB[Local knowledge base<br/>knowledge_base]
        KB --> RC[Retrieved context]
        RC --> PM[Context-grounded prompt]
        PM --> AM[Gemini 2.5 Flash API]
        AM --> GA[Grounded answer]
        GA --> SA[Source attribution]
        SA --> UI
        UI --> HR[Human review]
        HR -. Adjust question or plan .-> UI
    end

    GU[Guardrails and error handling] -. Missing key, empty or irrelevant question, missing files, API failure .-> UI
    AM -. Invalid or empty response .-> GU
    RT -. No relevant passage .-> GU

    AT[Automated pytest suite] --> E1[Scheduler and UI tests]
    AT --> E2[Retrieval and prompt tests]
    AT --> E3[Mocked model and error tests]
    AT -. Evaluation evidence .-> README[README results]
